## Data model
<!-- Define entities, validation, ownership, durability, migrations and retention. -->
Demonstration notes have an ID, text (1–500 characters after trimming) and a UTC creation timestamp.
Preferences are namespaced by APP_SLUG; demo notes are disposable and need a stronger store for important data.

